#   fib - Example of a native module: fib(n) computed natively
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of QuickJS's examples/fib.c, the native module examples/test_fib.js imports
#       (as "./fib.so"). An embedder links it in and registers it with
#       host.js_register_native_module("fib", fib.js_init_module_fib), as ljs does.
